It's very dark and you can't see further than your stretched arm. You can hear some animals moving up and down the adjacent trees; you become a bit nervous. No one can guarantee that all predators of the island are unapt to climb trees. But, the decision is made, and there is no way of changing it. 
Suddenly, a loud roaring sounded under the tree, snapping of twigs and a heartrending screech. Soon the screech broke, and changed by blood chilling silence, that let you hear horrible sounds of flesh, being torn apart. It looks like some large predator caught his prey. You press yourself to the tree trunk, trying not make noise. Horrible sounds die down with time. Soon, the night is full of sounds again, made by forest habitants. Your eyes are getting heavy, mind get clouded...You fall asleep.       